 "media": [
  {
   "mediaId": "1-4-intro-video",
   "kind": "video",
   "runtimePath": "lessons/1-4/media/1-4-intro-video.mp4",
   "sha256": "77e96afaaa06aaf3245987bf6408fd1223851d0153279a28b173cb7f879965ff",
   "durationSeconds": 303.786667,
   "transcriptSource": "videos-project:lesson-1-4/assets/audio/captions.generated.ts",
   "narrationDurationSeconds": 283.733,
   "offsetSeconds": 10.0,
   "expectedDurationSeconds": 303.733,
   "offsetVerified": true,
   "offsetStatus": "verified",
   "cueCount": 72,
   "segments": [
    {
     "index": 0,
     "startSeconds": 10.0,
     "endSeconds": 18.41,
     "textPreview": "大家好，欢迎来到闲聊自控。今天看同一个系统的两双眼睛。还是那条船。驾驶员下令右转",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 1,
     "startSeconds": 18.41,
     "endSeconds": 29.3,
     "textPreview": "航向角平稳到位，还是冲过头再回来？前者关心过程——输出怎样随时间展开。几分钟后，",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 2,
     "startSeconds": 29.3,
     "endSeconds": 38.17,
     "textPreview": "慢浪快浪，船都跟着晃，还是只挑一类晃？后者关心节律——系统对不同频率的态度。",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 3,
     "startSeconds": 38.17,
     "endSeconds": 49.57,
     "textPreview": "同一条船，两类问题，要用两把尺子来量。第一把尺子是老朋友：时域。对象还是那套船舶",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 4,
     "startSeconds": 49.57,
     "endSeconds": 61.29,
     "textPreview": "K 取 1，响应慢吞吞地单调爬升。K 取 4，临界阻尼，最快的单调到位。K 取 ",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 5,
     "startSeconds": 61.71,
     "endSeconds": 73.13,
     "textPreview": "一条曲线，看清每一秒系统在做什么。这就是时域：全过程的可视化。但它答不上来：固定",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 6,
     "startSeconds": 73.13,
     "endSeconds": 81.72,
     "textPreview": "要回答这个，得换第二把尺子。如果输入不是跳一下，而是一直摆呢？",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 7,
     "startSeconds": 81.72,
     "endSeconds": 90.9,
     "textPreview": "正弦进去，稳态之后，还是同频率的正弦出来。变的只有两样：幅度缩了多少，节拍慢了多",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 8,
     "startSeconds": 90.9,
     "endSeconds": 99.4,
     "textPreview": "慢慢摆，系统跟得很完整；催得急，就跟不上。幅度缩水，滞后加重——这就是频率响应。",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-object-8496155b16d82318d90949d0",
       "matchedLabel": "频率响应",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 9,
     "startSeconds": 99.4,
     "endSeconds": 110.53,
     "textPreview": "这台弹簧装置，正在演示这种差别。激励节奏逼近固有频率，振幅会被明显放大。对不同节",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 10,
     "startSeconds": 112.53,
     "endSeconds": 124.02,
     "textPreview": "这张地图叫 Bode 图，上下两条曲线。横轴是频率，对数刻度，从慢排到快。上图读",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-504581e399675b9792ab8502",
       "matchedLabel": "Bode 图",
       "labelKind": "alias",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 12,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 11,
     "startSeconds": 124.02,
     "endSeconds": 135.51,
     "textPreview": "下图读相位：输出滞后了多少度。读图先认通道：这条是闭环指令传递。低频贴着零分贝：",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 12,
     "startSeconds": 135.51,
     "endSeconds": 144.45,
     "textPreview": "频率升高，曲线掉头向下：快指令跟不上。从低频水平掉 3 分贝的位置，叫闭环带宽。",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-object-69488c745082536d87afd1a7",
       "matchedLabel": "闭环带宽",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": false,
       "score": 8,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 13,
     "startSeconds": 144.45,
     "endSeconds": 154.79,
     "textPreview": "本例大约 2.83 弧度每秒。换一张：环路开环的 Bode 图。它与零分贝线的交",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-object-7761615701fb4915a76924ff",
       "matchedLabel": "穿越频率",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      },
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-504581e399675b9792ab8502",
       "matchedLabel": "Bode 图",
       "labelKind": "alias",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 12,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 14,
     "startSeconds": 154.79,
     "endSeconds": 163.1,
     "textPreview": "本例约 1.82 弧度每秒。两个数字接近，但定义完全不同。一个管闭环跟随，一个管",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 15,
     "startSeconds": 165.1,
     "endSeconds": 177.25,
     "textPreview": "Bode 图把幅值相位拆成两张。Nyquist 图把它们画进复平面。每个频率是一",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-object-763fd65e573e7a65dfc4b79c",
       "matchedLabel": "Nyquist 图",
       "labelKind": "alias",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 18,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      },
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-504581e399675b9792ab8502",
       "matchedLabel": "Bode 图",
       "labelKind": "alias",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 12,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 16,
     "startSeconds": 177.25,
     "endSeconds": 186.33,
     "textPreview": "频率从低到高，这些点连成轨迹。读三件事：起点在哪，终点收在哪，还有曲线离临界点 ",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 17,
     "startSeconds": 186.33,
     "endSeconds": 198.9,
     "textPreview": "它和 Bode 图是同一套信息的两种摆法。不信就来翻译一次：频率取 2。Bode",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-504581e399675b9792ab8502",
       "matchedLabel": "Bode 图",
       "labelKind": "alias",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 24,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 18,
     "startSeconds": 198.9,
     "endSeconds": 207.96,
     "textPreview": "Nyquist 图上：离原点 0.112，角度 -117 度。一模一样——这就是",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-object-763fd65e573e7a65dfc4b79c",
       "matchedLabel": "Nyquist 图",
       "labelKind": "alias",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 18,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 19,
     "startSeconds": 210.1,
     "endSeconds": 218.43,
     "textPreview": "现在，把同一个系统放进四个窗口。复平面窗口：闭环极点在 -2 加减 2j。",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 20,
     "startSeconds": 218.43,
     "endSeconds": 229.77,
     "textPreview": "时域窗口：超调百分之四出头，一秒多收敛。两张频域窗口，画的是环路开环。注意分工：",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 21,
     "startSeconds": 229.77,
     "endSeconds": 239.21,
     "textPreview": "极点离开实轴，正好解释阶跃响应的摆动。四张图被同一组参数驱动，互相印证。但别指望",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:modeling-a30f001ebd5a123a456a51da",
       "matchedLabel": "阶跃响应",
       "labelKind": "alias",
       "inScope": false,
       "score": 4,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 22,
     "startSeconds": 241.2,
     "endSeconds": 253.73,
     "textPreview": "回到船上，把证据链补齐。极点说：有振荡模态，但会收敛。阶跃说：超调 4.32%，",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 23,
     "startSeconds": 254.15,
     "endSeconds": 263.22,
     "textPreview": "频域说：慢指令几乎全额通过，到了每秒 3 弧度，幅度只剩三分之二。可靠的判断，从",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 24,
     "startSeconds": 263.22,
     "endSeconds": 274.96,
     "textPreview": "先标通道，再多图联读——本讲的硬习惯。时域看过程，频域看节律。复平面上的极点，把",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 25,
     "startSeconds": 274.96,
     "endSeconds": 284.92,
     "textPreview": "Bode 图和 Nyquist 图，同源，只是摆法不同。下一讲，把这三张图搬进平",
